iiSU Database (iiDB) integration
--------------------------------
Special thanks to the iiSU team and community for creating iiDB and for the incredible
work behind its growing collection of game artwork and soundbites. Their passion for
presentation, preservation, and beautifully curated game assets has made Launch
Curtain's iiDB integration possible. Huge thanks for building such a valuable resource
for the gaming community and for making these assets accessible to projects like this one.

Launch Curtain can search and download game artwork and Soundbites from the iiSU
Database (iiDB), operated by iiSU Network. iiSU/iiDB content remains subject to
the iiSU Network license and attribution requirements.

    iiSU Network / iiSU Database (iiDB)
    https://iisu.network/
    License: https://iisu.network/license

Launch Curtain's MIT license does not relicense third-party iiSU/iiDB content.

SteamGridDB Hero integration
----------------------------
Launch Curtain can query Hero artwork through the public SteamGridDB API v2 using
a personal API key supplied by the user. Launch Curtain does not bundle an API key.
SteamGridDB artwork and service content are third-party content and are not relicensed
by Launch Curtain.

    SteamGridDB
    https://www.steamgriddb.com/
    API: https://www.steamgriddb.com/api/v2
    Terms: https://www.steamgriddb.com/terms
